        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hapn" value="Checks Patroni :8008 on every node every 3 s (fall 3 / rise 2); a node that loses its role gets its sessions shut down. maxconn 4000, timeouts 30 min." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="hap">
          <mxGeometry x="15" y="195" width="230" height="95" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="kan" value="&lt;b&gt;keepalived:&lt;/b&gt; unicast VRRP between the 3 env nodes, all BACKUP + nopreempt, priority 100/90/80. chk_haproxy curls 127.0.0.1:8404/health every 2 s; on failure the VIP moves and does not move back.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Patroni:&lt;/b&gt; leader key in etcd (TTL 30 s). Leader loss → healthiest replica promoted (prod: only the Sync Standby); old leader rejoins via pg_rewind. etcd down to 1 member → leader demotes itself (read-only)." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="pp">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="280" width="360" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
