        <mxCell id="p2legend" value="&lt;div style='text-align:left'&gt;&lt;b style='font-size:13px'&gt;Ports &amp;amp; protocols (from role defaults / firewall role)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;table style='font-size:11px;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:4px'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th align='left'&gt;Port&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align='left'&gt;Proto&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align='left'&gt;Path&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;&lt;b&gt;443 / 8006&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;HTTPS&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;Workstation → Proxmox VE API 10.50.200.11 (API token; provision --tags vms)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;&lt;b&gt;22&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;SSH&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;Admin net → PVE-11 (root, template build) and pgdb* (user ansible, key-only)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;&lt;b&gt;5000&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;TCP&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;Clients → VIP → HAProxy 'primary' (read-write) → PgBouncer :6432 on the leader&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;&lt;b&gt;5001&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;TCP&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;Clients → VIP → HAProxy 'replicas' (read-only, roundrobin, lag ≤ 16MB) → PgBouncer :6432&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;&lt;b&gt;6432&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;TCP&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;PgBouncer (transaction pooling); HAProxy backends + direct admin/app access&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;&lt;b&gt;5432&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;TCP&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;PostgreSQL 18: PgBouncer → 127.0.0.1, WAL streaming (replicator, slots), pg_rewind&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;&lt;b&gt;8008&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;HTTP&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;Patroni REST: HAProxy health checks /primary /replica, peers, Prometheus /metrics&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;&lt;b&gt;2379&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;HTTPS mTLS&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;etcd client: Patroni → etcd (per-env CA)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;&lt;b&gt;2380&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;HTTPS mTLS&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;etcd peer: raft between the 3 members (quorum 2/3)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;&lt;b&gt;2381&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;HTTP&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;etcd /metrics (Prometheus only)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;&lt;b&gt;8404&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;HTTP&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;HAProxy stats /stats, /health (keepalived check), /metrics&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;&lt;b&gt;VRRP (112)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;IP proto&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;keepalived unicast between env nodes; VRID dev 242 / prod 246&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;&lt;b&gt;9100 / 9187 / 9127&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;HTTP&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc'&gt;node_exporter / postgres_exporter / pgbouncer_exporter → Prometheus 10.45.66.120&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;div style='margin-top:6px;font-size:11px'&gt;&lt;span style='color:#b85450'&gt;&lt;b&gt;━━&lt;/b&gt; read-write&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style='color:#3b6db3'&gt;&lt;b&gt;╍╍&lt;/b&gt; read-only&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style='color:#9673a6'&gt;&lt;b&gt;━━&lt;/b&gt; WAL streaming&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style='color:#d79b00'&gt;&lt;b&gt;┈┈&lt;/b&gt; etcd raft / DCS&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style='color:#82b366'&gt;&lt;b&gt;╍╍&lt;/b&gt; monitoring scrape&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style='color:#b85450'&gt;dashed red box = gap / not in repo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
